    {
      "parameters": {
        "functionCode": "// Build the Claude API request body with narrative_role classifier\nconst messageText = $input.item.json.message_text || '';\nconst source = $input.item.json.source || 'unknown';\nconst timestamp = $input.item.json.timestamp || new Date().toISOString();\n\n// Role definitions for accurate classification\nconst roleGuide = `\n- realisation: insight, breakthrough, understanding, clarity, epiphany, aha-moment\n- exploration: question, curiosity, investigation, research, trying, experimenting\n- conflict: tension, problem, contradiction, difficulty, obstacle, error\n- symbol: metaphor, archetype, image, myth, spiritual, dream, ceremony\n- system: architecture, structure, tool, process, rule, protocol, design\n- orphaned: DO NOT assign this — reserved for entries with no crosslinks after 7 days\n`.trim();\n\nconst prompt = `Analyze this Slack message and extract NEYEN knowledge graph metadata.\n\nMessage: ${messageText}\nSource: ${source}\nTimestamp: ${timestamp}\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON (no markdown, no explanation):\n{\n  \"tags\": [\"tag1\", \"tag2\", \"tag3\"],\n  \"entities\": [\"entity1\", \"entity2\"],\n  \"summary\": \"1-2 sentence summary\",\n  \"narrative_role\": \"one of the 6 roles below\",\n  \"date_estimated\": \"YYYY-MM-DD or YYYY\",\n  \"timeline_group\": \"1974-1990|2019-2023|2024-2026\"\n}\n\nNarrative role — choose EXACTLY one (never use orphaned):\n${roleGuide}\n\nRules:\n- tags: 3-5 lowercase keywords capturing the core topic\n- entities: named people, companies, systems, or key concepts\n- summary: factual, present-tense, max 2 sentences\n- narrative_role: best fit from the 6 options above — if unclear, choose exploration\n- date_estimated: infer from message context or use the timestamp date\n- timeline_group: map to the closest period`;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    ...$input.item.json,\n    claudeRequestBody: JSON.stringify({\n      model: 'claude-haiku-4-5-20251001',\n      max_tokens: 1024,\n      messages: [{ role: 'user', content: prompt }]\n    })\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "build-claude-request",
      "name": "Build Claude Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.function",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1050,
        350
      ]
    },
